{"seq":1,"slug":"rope-scaling","title":"RoPE 缩放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/rope-scaling","wordCount":1398,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"rope-缩放\">RoPE 缩放</h1><p>2023 年一群开源社区的实验者发现了一件几乎免费的好事：只要在推理时把 RoPE 的位置&quot;压缩&quot;一下，一个在 4K 上训练的 LLaMA 就能勉强读 8K，再配一点微调甚至能上 128K。这一族技术——位置插值、NTK-aware、YaRN——是当下把模型窗口撑大的主流路径，Qwen、DeepSeek、LLaMA、gpt-oss 等几乎都在用（<a href=\"https://mljourney.com/how-to-extend-context-length-in-llms-rope-scaling-yarn-and-ntk-aware-interpolation/\">ML Journey, 2025</a>）。本篇专讲&quot;怎么改 RoPE 的频率把窗口撑大&quot;，前提是你已读过 <a href=\"../foundations/positional-encoding-basics\">位置编码基础</a> 里 RoPE 的旋转机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-外推-vs-内插\">核心概念：外推 vs 内插</h2><p>RoPE 在超出训练长度时崩坏，是因为高频维度的旋转角进入了训练时没见过的取值。有两条路应对：<strong>外推</strong>——让模型硬着头皮处理更大的旋转角（几乎总是崩）；<strong>内插</strong>——把更长的位置&quot;压缩&quot;回训练见过的角度范围。RoPE 缩放的全部手段本质都是内插的变体，区别在于&quot;怎么压&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[训练长度 L, 目标长度 L&#39;] --&gt; B{如何处理超长位置}&#10;  B --&gt;|外推 直接外延| C[旋转角超训练范围&lt;br/&gt;注意力崩坏]&#10;  B --&gt;|位置插值 PI| D[全频率等比压缩&lt;br/&gt;position/scale]&#10;  B --&gt;|NTK-aware| E[按频率非均匀缩放&lt;br/&gt;高频少压 低频多压]&#10;  B --&gt;|YaRN| F[NTK-by-parts + 注意力温度&lt;br/&gt;分频带 + 缩放 softmax]&#10;  D --&gt; G[低频信息被过度压缩]&#10;  E --&gt; H[免微调即可中等延长]&#10;  F --&gt; I[大倍数延长的最佳质量]\">graph TD\n  A[训练长度 L, 目标长度 L'] --&gt; B{如何处理超长位置}\n  B --&gt;|外推 直接外延| C[旋转角超训练范围&lt;br/&gt;注意力崩坏]\n  B --&gt;|位置插值 PI| D[全频率等比压缩&lt;br/&gt;position/scale]\n  B --&gt;|NTK-aware| E[按频率非均匀缩放&lt;br/&gt;高频少压 低频多压]\n  B --&gt;|YaRN| F[NTK-by-parts + 注意力温度&lt;br/&gt;分频带 + 缩放 softmax]\n  D --&gt; G[低频信息被过度压缩]\n  E --&gt; H[免微调即可中等延长]\n  F --&gt; I[大倍数延长的最佳质量]</pre><p>下表把四种方案的核心机制与适用场景对照，是本篇的导航。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>需要微调吗</th>\n<th>适用扩展倍数</th>\n<th>代价/局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接外推</td>\n<td>不处理</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>几乎不可用</td>\n<td>立即崩坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置插值 PI</td>\n<td>所有频率等比压缩位置</td>\n<td>通常需短微调</td>\n<td>2–4×</td>\n<td>高频细节被压损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NTK-aware</td>\n<td>按频率非均匀缩放 base</td>\n<td>免微调可用</td>\n<td>2–4× 免调，更大需调</td>\n<td>大倍数下退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YaRN</td>\n<td>NTK-by-parts + 注意力温度</td>\n<td>短微调最佳</td>\n<td>8× 及以上</td>\n<td>实现稍复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"位置插值-pi-最朴素的压缩\">位置插值 PI：最朴素的压缩</h2><p>位置插值（Position Interpolation，Chen 等，2023）的想法朴素到近乎暴力：要把窗口从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 扩到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就把每个位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 替换成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\cdot L/L&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即给所有位置乘一个小于 1 的缩放因子。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>↦</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>scale</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\mapsto m \\cdot \\frac{L}{L&#x27;}, \\quad \\text{scale} = \\frac{L&#x27;}{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.522em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scale</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1149em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4289em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这样最大有效位置又回到了训练见过的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, L]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 范围，旋转角不再越界。PI 的问题是它对<strong>所有频率一视同仁地压缩</strong>：高频维度本来负责区分相邻 token 的细微位置差，被压缩后这种分辨率下降，相邻 token 变得&quot;挤在一起&quot;难以区分。所以 PI 单用质量有限，几乎都要配一轮短微调来恢复，扩展倍数也通常止于 2–4 倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ntk-aware-高频少压-低频多压\">NTK-aware：高频少压、低频多压</h2><p>NTK-aware 缩放（社区&quot;bloc97&quot;提出）从神经正切核（NTK）理论得到一个关键改进：不该对所有频率等比压缩。高频维度负责近距离分辨率，最不能压；低频维度负责远距离，可以多压。它的实现优雅——只改 RoPE 的底数 base：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>base</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i = (\\text{base} \\cdot \\alpha)^{-2i/d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.188em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>通过放大 base，高频维度几乎不受影响、保住近距离分辨率，低频维度被有效拉长以容纳更远位置。其最大卖点是<strong>免微调即可中等延长</strong>：实验显示 NTK-aware 能让 LLaMA 在不做任何微调、困惑度仅轻微上升的情况下扩到 8K 以上（<a href=\"https://mljourney.com/how-to-extend-context-length-in-llms-rope-scaling-yarn-and-ntk-aware-interpolation/\">mljourney, 2025</a>）。但在更大扩展倍数下，简单 NTK 仍会退化，需要更精细的分频带处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"yarn-当前大倍数延长的事实标准\">YaRN：当前大倍数延长的事实标准</h2><p>YaRN（&quot;Yet Another RoPE extensioN&quot;，Peng 等，2023）把前面的洞见推到工程化的完整方案，由两部分组成。第一是 <strong>NTK-by-parts</strong>：把频率维度明确分成三个频带——高频维度完全不插值（保近距离分辨率）、低频维度做位置插值（容纳远距离）、中间频带平滑过渡。第二是引入<strong>注意力温度</strong>：在 softmax 前给 logits 乘一个随扩展倍数变化的缩放因子，补偿长序列下注意力熵的变化，进一步提升长序列质量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>softmax</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>scale</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{softmax}\\left(\\frac{t \\cdot QK^\\top}{\\sqrt{d}}\\right), \\quad t = f(\\text{scale})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4761em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1778em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scale</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>YaRN 的实践地位很明确：当你愿意跑一轮短微调、且要做 8 倍以上的大扩展时，它给出最好的质量。Qwen2-72B-Instruct 就是在 32K 长度训练后，用 YaRN 外推到 128K 的（<a href=\"https://mljourney.com/how-to-extend-context-length-in-llms-rope-scaling-yarn-and-ntk-aware-interpolation/\">ML Journey, 2025</a>）。也正因为这一点，YaRN 几乎成了开源长上下文模型的默认配方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缩放不是终点-必须配训练\">缩放不是终点：必须配训练</h2><p>一个常见误解是&quot;配好 RoPE 缩放就能用了&quot;。真相是：纯靠缩放（哪怕 YaRN）能让模型&quot;不崩&quot;，但要在长上下文上稳定、准确地工作，几乎都要再过一轮长度课程的继续预训练或微调，让模型真正适应被压缩后的位置分布与更长的依赖。缩放提供位置层面的可行性，训练提供质量层面的可靠性，两者缺一不可——这条流程是 <a href=\"context-extension-finetuning\">长度外推与微调</a> 的主题。同时，缩放扩大的窗口仍逃不过中间遗失，详见 <a href=\"../practice/context-rot-failures\">中间遗失与上下文腐烂</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RoPE 超长崩坏源于高频维度旋转角越界；解法是内插而非外推。</li>\n<li>位置插值 PI 等比压缩所有频率，简单但损高频分辨率，需微调，倍数有限。</li>\n<li>NTK-aware 通过放大 base 实现高频少压、低频多压，免微调即可中等延长。</li>\n<li>YaRN = NTK-by-parts（分频带）+ 注意力温度，是大倍数（8×+）延长的事实标准，Qwen 等广泛采用。</li>\n<li>缩放只给&quot;不崩&quot;，质量靠后续长度微调，且仍受中间遗失制约。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>RoPE 的旋转机制（前置）：<a href=\"../foundations/positional-encoding-basics\">位置编码基础</a></li>\n<li>缩放后如何训出可靠模型：<a href=\"context-extension-finetuning\">长度外推与微调</a></li>\n<li>扩大窗口仍有的质量上限：<a href=\"../practice/context-rot-failures\">中间遗失与上下文腐烂</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：参数高效微调如何配合长度训练——<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/fine-tuning-fundamentals/why-fine-tune\">LLM 微调 · 为什么微调</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RoPE 缩放","id":"rope-缩放"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：外推 vs 内插","id":"核心概念-外推-vs-内插"},{"level":2,"text":"位置插值 PI：最朴素的压缩","id":"位置插值-pi-最朴素的压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"NTK-aware：高频少压、低频多压","id":"ntk-aware-高频少压-低频多压"},{"level":2,"text":"YaRN：当前大倍数延长的事实标准","id":"yarn-当前大倍数延长的事实标准"},{"level":2,"text":"缩放不是终点：必须配训练","id":"缩放不是终点-必须配训练"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"位置编码基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/positional-encoding-basics"},"next":{"title":"稀疏与局部注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/sparse-local-attention"}}